# THE KNIFE ON THE REAPER'S PLATE (roadmap slice 1, step 3). The iron knife the
# player wakes with rings off the Tide Reaper even in its open part: it is
# plated in steel (roster `plating`, FightRules.bites). The first ring says so,
# and the goal line turns to the steel edge -- a kiln, charcoal, the knife
# tempered -- with the reason. Over the shoulder.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/reaper_plating.tour --seed=7 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --held=knife --config=unharmed
coast calm
near keeper
wait 0.6
await sentinel 12
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
try 8
  walkto mob 6
  await tell 14
  press dodge 0.12
  await sentinel_open 6
  walkto part 2
  tap swing
  await plating 5
end
wait 0.4
shot 01-the-knife-rings-off-its-plate with shoulder,mob:sentinel.coast,plating
# Out of its reach, where the glass is not kept quiet by a fight: the goal line
# has turned to the steel edge, and says why.
walk 1,0 4 run
walk 0,-1 3 run
wait 2.5
shot 02-away-the-goal-asks-for-steel with shoulder
